        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-300 font-medium">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Catering para reuniões e plantões</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Entrega pontual programada</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-amber-400">✓</span> Cortes nobres sem misturas industriais</li>
        </ul>
